   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor null
   * @x-autobe-specification Query shopping_mall_products table with pagination and filtering by name, description, base_price, created_at range, updated_at range, and active status (deleted_at is null). Apply exact match, partial text match (trigram), and range filters based on request criteria. Join with shopping_mall_product_variants to ensure only products with available variants are returned. Apply pagination with cursor-based offset and limit. Return only active products (deleted_at IS NULL).
